        "rationale": "Subparagraph (A) (represented by baseline C0000) requires advance notice and a copy of the complaint before filing. Subparagraph (B)(i) (represented by C0001) specifies that Subparagraph (A) does not apply if the attorney general determines that providing advance notice is not feasible. Setting qualifies to C0000 with relation exception accurately reflects this statutory qualification, and the updated actor, action, and summary faithfully adhere to F006 without conflating the separate notification duty in clause (ii).",
