        "rationale": "Clause (i) (C0001) exempts an action from the pre-filing notice requirements of Subparagraph (A) (C0000). It does not qualify clause (ii) (C0002); rather, C0002 imposes an affirmative simultaneous notice duty for actions described in clause (i). Therefore, targeting C0002 under qualifies is incorrect. Additionally, the summary improperly conflates C0001 with the separate duty in C0002.",
